<title>MONACO: TENNIS-MONTE CARLO OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MONTE CARLO OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MONTE CARLO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third round results in the $2.3 million Monte Carlo men's tennis Open on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>7-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat 10-Albert Costa (Spain) 7-6 (7-3) 6-4</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 7-5 6-0</p>
<p>12-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) 4-6 7-6 (7-5) 6-0</p>
<p>Fabrice Santoro (France) beat 16-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) 3-6 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>Carlos Costa (Spain) beat Arnaud Boestch (France) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Christian Ruud (Norway) beat Emilio Alvarez (Spain) 5-7 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3)</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Mark Philippoussis</p>
<p>(Australia) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>6-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 6-4 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3)</p>
</text>
